<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卫星安全 on Oight</title><link>https://Oight.github.io/categories/%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 卫星安全 on Oight</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Oight</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:29:47 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Oight.github.io/categories/%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hack-A-Sat-qualifier-2020 复现</title><link>https://Oight.github.io/p/hack-a-sat-qualifier-2020-%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:29:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Oight.github.io/p/hack-a-sat-qualifier-2020-%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="hack-a-sat-qualifier-2020-复现">Hack-A-Sat-qualifier-2020 复现
&lt;/h1>&lt;p>又开新坑了，从未接触过的全新领域——卫星安全！&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="beckley">beckley
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>这道题更像是传统CTF MISC中的OSINT算是初步接触卫星安全领域的开胃小菜吧&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="环境配置">环境配置
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>首先从 &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/yichen115/hackasat-qualifier-2020.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>yichen115的仓库&lt;/a>中拉取题目&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">git clone https://github.com/yichen115/hackasat-qualifier-2020.git
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">cd&lt;/span> hackasat-qualifier-2020
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 然后构建基础镜像&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">cd&lt;/span> hackasat-qualifier-2020
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker build -t generator-base .
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">cd&lt;/span> ..
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>由于原来Dockerfile中sgp4库的版本太旧了，需要修改sgp4库的版本&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vim challenge/Dockerfile
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>修改成这样：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">FROM ubuntu:16.04
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">#Install Apache, Python, Curl. Enable CGI. Install PIP, use PIP to install skyfield&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RUN sed -i s@/archive.ubuntu.com/@/mirrors.aliyun.com/@g /etc/apt/sources.list&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> apt-get update -y&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> apt-get install -y apache2 python curl&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> a2enmod cgi&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> curl https://bootstrap.pypa.io/pip/2.7/get-pip.py -o get-pip.py&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> python get-pip.py&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> pip install skyfield &lt;span class="nv">sgp4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>2.15&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">COPY errors /etc/apache2/sites-enabled/000-default.conf
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">COPY custom_50x.html /var/www/html/custom_50x.html
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">WORKDIR /usr/lib/cgi-bin
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># Upload all files to cgi-bin directory&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">COPY *.py ./
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">COPY entrypoint.sh ./
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">COPY deltat.* ./
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">COPY Leap_Second.dat ./
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RUN chmod +x challenge.py
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># Suppress error output&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RUN &lt;span class="nb">echo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;ServerName beckley.mydomain.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &amp;gt;&amp;gt; /etc/apache2/apache2.conf
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">#ENV FLAG=flag{Hungry_For_Apples}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># RUN&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ENTRYPOINT ./entrypoint.sh
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>然后使用&lt;code>make build&lt;/code>生成镜像，也可以用&lt;code>make challenge&lt;/code>只生成题目镜像&lt;/p>
&lt;p>然后就可以启动题目了&lt;/p>
&lt;p>使用以下命令启动题目容器：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">socat -v tcp-listen:19020,reuseaddr exec:&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;docker run --rm -i -e SERVICE_HOST=172.17.0.1 -e SERVICE_PORT=19021 -e SEED=1000 -e FLAG=flag{zulu49225delta\:GG1EnNVMK3-hPvlNKAdEJxcujvp9WK4rEchuEdlDp3yv_Wh_uvB5ehGq-fyRowvwkWpdAMTKbidqhK4JhFsaz1k} -p 19021\:80 beckley\:challenge&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>这道题需要启3个终端来交互第一个终端运行上面的命令启动容器&lt;/p>
&lt;p>第二个终端需要使用&lt;code>nc&lt;/code>访问题目容器&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">nc 172.17.0.1 &lt;span class="m">19020&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>第三个终端用来提交答案获取flag，可以先尝试随便传点东西测试题目环境是否搭建成功&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">curl http://172.17.0.1:19021/cgi-bin/HSCKML.py?CAMERA&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>0,0,0,0,0 -H &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;User-Agent: GoogleEarth/7.3.2.5815(X11;Linux (5.2.0.0);en;kml:2.2;client:Pro;type:default)&amp;#39;&lt;/span> -H &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Accept: application/vnd.google-earth.kml+xml, application/vnd.google-earth.kmz, image/*, */*&amp;#39;&lt;/span> -H &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Accept-Language: en-US, *&amp;#39;&lt;/span> -H &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Connection: keep-alive&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>连接成功后会返回xml的响应：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">&amp;lt;?xml version=&amp;#34;1.0&amp;#34; encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;?&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;kml&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">xmlns=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;Placemark&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/span>Keep Looking...&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;Point&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;coordinates&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0.000000,0.000000&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/coordinates&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/Point&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/Placemark&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/kml&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>搭建成功后就像这样：&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://i0.wp.com/tvax4.sinaimg.cn/large/009XQ7msly1ii4iaoye4sj31tm10ze81.jpg"
loading="lazy"
alt="图片"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="解题">解题
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>现在我们就可以正式开始解题了，先看看nc给我们的题目描述&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://i0.wp.com/tvax1.sinaimg.cn/large/009XQ7msly1ii4ica93gtj30yn081782.jpg"
loading="lazy"
alt="图片"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>这里的意思是太空中有颗卫星于 2020 年 3 月 26 日 21:53:13 按照特定的视角拍到了华盛顿纪念碑，我们需要伪造一个Google earth Pro的KML文件来获取flag&lt;/p>
&lt;p>附件中给了我们KML的文件格式：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="cp">&amp;lt;?xml version=&amp;#34;1.0&amp;#34; encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;?&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;kml&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">xmlns=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;Folder&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/span>HackASatCompetition&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;visibility&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/visibility&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;open&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/open&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;&lt;/span>HackASatComp1&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;NetworkLink&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/span>View Centered Placemark&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;visibility&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/visibility&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;open&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/open&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;&lt;/span>This is where the satellite was located when we saw it.&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;refreshVisibility&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/refreshVisibility&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;flyToView&amp;gt;&lt;/span>0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/flyToView&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;LookAt&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">id=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;ID&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- specific to LookAt --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;longitude&amp;gt;&lt;/span>FILL ME IN&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/longitude&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- kml:angle180 --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;latitude&amp;gt;&lt;/span>FILL ME IN TOO&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/latitude&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- kml:angle90 --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;altitude&amp;gt;&lt;/span>FILL ME IN AS WELL&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/altitude&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- double --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;heading&amp;gt;&lt;/span>FILL IN THIS VALUE&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/heading&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- kml:angle360 --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;tilt&amp;gt;&lt;/span>FILL IN THIS VALUE TOO&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/tilt&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- kml:anglepos90 --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;range&amp;gt;&lt;/span>FILL IN THIS VALUE ALSO&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/range&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c">&amp;lt;!-- double --&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;altitudeMode&amp;gt;&lt;/span>clampToGround&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/altitudeMode&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/LookAt&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;Link&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;href&amp;gt;&lt;/span>http://FILL ME IN:FILL ME IN/cgi-bin/HSCKML.py&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/href&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;refreshInterval&amp;gt;&lt;/span>1&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/refreshInterval&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;viewRefreshMode&amp;gt;&lt;/span>onStop&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/viewRefreshMode&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;viewRefreshTime&amp;gt;&lt;/span>1&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/viewRefreshTime&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;viewFormat&amp;gt;&lt;/span>BBOX=[bboxWest],[bboxSouth],[bboxEast],[bboxNorth];CAMERA=[lookatLon],[lookatLat],[lookatRange],[lookatTilt],[lookatHeading];VIEW=[horizFov],[vertFov],[horizPixels],[vertPixels],[terrainEnabled]&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/viewFormat&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/Link&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/NetworkLink&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/Folder&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/kml&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>我们需要提交的参数有6个：&lt;code>longitude&lt;/code>, &lt;code>latitude&lt;/code>, &lt;code>altitude&lt;/code>, &lt;code>heading&lt;/code>, &lt;code>tilt&lt;/code>, &lt;code>range&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>longitude 是华盛顿纪念碑的经度，latitude 是华盛顿纪念碑的纬度，altitude 是纪念碑的海拔，但由于这里&lt;code>altitudeMode&lt;/code>是clampToGround，所以可以填0，华盛顿纪念碑的经纬度我们可以通过谷歌地图得到&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://i0.wp.com/tvax3.sinaimg.cn/large/009XQ7msly1ii4ikgb8cyj30il0kjtg6.jpg"
loading="lazy"
alt="图片"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>我们还需要&lt;code>heading&lt;/code>, &lt;code>tilt&lt;/code>, 和 &lt;code>range&lt;/code>三个参数&lt;/p>
&lt;p>heading 是飞行器前进的方向&lt;/p>
&lt;p>tilt 是卫星与地球表面法线之间的角度&lt;/p>
&lt;p>range 是卫星距离目标的距离&lt;/p>
&lt;p>这三个参数我们可以从题目一开始给出的信息中获取：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">The image was taken on March 26th, 2020, at 21:53:13
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">The satellite we used was:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">REDACT
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span> 13337U 98067A 20087.38052801 -.00000452 00000-0 00000+0 &lt;span class="m">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="m">9995&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="m">2&lt;/span> &lt;span class="m">13337&lt;/span> 51.6460 33.2488 &lt;span class="m">0005270&lt;/span> 61.9928 83.3154 15.48919755219337
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>题目中给出了卫星的TLE（Two-Line Element set），TLE的格式是这样的：&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>第 1 行&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>字段&lt;/th>
&lt;th>值&lt;/th>
&lt;th>含义&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>行号&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>1&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>第一行&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>卫星编号&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>13337&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>NORAD 目录编号&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>分类&lt;/td>
